{"results":[{"url":"https://www.wnd.com/2020/10/delaware-gop-senate-candidate-says-sen-chris-coons-daughter-featured-hunters-laptop/","final_url":"https://www.wnd.com/2020/10/delaware-gop-senate-candidate-says-sen-chris-coons-daughter-featured-hunters-laptop/","title":"Delaware GOP Senate candidate says Sen. Chris Coons’ daughter is ‘featured on Hunter’s laptop’ * WorldNetDaily * by Around the Web","description":"... Read more","language":"en","text":"# Delaware GOP Senate candidate says Sen. Chris Coons' daughter is 'featured on Hunter's laptop'\n\nWitzke made the allegation in an interview with Breitbart News\n\nBy Around the Web\n\nOctober 25, 2020\n\n(GATEWAY PUNDIT) Delaware Republican senate candidate Lauren Witzke has alleged that a source close to the investigation into Hunter Biden's laptop has informed her that there are images of Senator Chris Coons' daughter, in addition to seven other underage girls.\n\nCoons' daughter, Maggie Coons, was infamously photographed being handled inappropriately by Joe Biden in 2015. His conduct towards her was widely criticized by the mainstream media at the time, particularly because he whispered into her ear and kissed her on the head as she looked terribly uncomfortable.\n\nRead the full story ›","author":"https://www.wnd.com/author/wndnewsservices/","published_date":"2020-10-25T13:09:24-04:00","latency_ms":18300.93167299856,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}